{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"CarsonWu"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["open","source","ai","agent"],"value":"Hi HN, I released CogCore, an early <em>open</em>-<em>source</em> TypeScript runtime for building <em>agents</em> around your application's own APIs.<p>GUI is designed for human, CLI was also for human at early times.\nThere must be a better native interface for <em>AI</em> to control computers. That will be &quot;API&quot;.\nCogCore just let <em>AI</em> write temporary code to take actions based on your app API. So it can run in a lightweight environment, like browser.<p>I would love any feedback on this project. Thanks."},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"partial","matchedWords":["agent"],"value":"Show HN: CogCore – An API-native TypeScript runtime for building <em>agents</em>"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://github.com/carsonDB/CogCore"}}

