{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"yusufnb"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["local","ai","model"],"value":"Hey HN,<p>I pivoted few months back from a B2B idea to B2C after talking to lots of developers and agencies. Looking for feedback, thoughts on this updated product launch.\nWhy another vibe coding platform?<p>First, this is not a vibe coding platform. It is a complete cloud website development platform with a vibe-coding interface. Underneath is a headless CMS, a static site builder, entire infrastructure and plumbing. This allows you to build one page landing site to a large multi-site corporate websites, all in one place.<p>It comes with a built in <em>AI</em> agent but also a unique Bring Your Own Agent approach that allows you to use expensive <em>models</em> via your subscriptions that you can run for hours on your <em>local</em> machine, that can give you amazing outputs. Think generating a large quality 100+ page corporate website with accurate data in a matter of couple of hours. Totally doable.<p>And to top that, there are no git repos, servers, databases or hosting providers to deal with.<p>Its a one man show so far, so please bear with any glitches/inconsistent docs.<p>Please give it a try. Feel free to reach me directly at yusuf at sleekcms for any questions, comments, partnerships, integrations.<p>Thanks."},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: SleekCMS – Lovable for Websites"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://www.sleekcms.com/"}}

